source: crates/daemon/tests/integration/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
List registered clients, or preview/revoke one

Usage: mxr serve clients [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  revoke  Preview by default; --confirm revokes credentials without cancelling mail work
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --format <FORMAT>  Structured output (json or jsonl) [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help             Print help
